  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "1. Have an avatar with something like a sets of breast bones\n2. Add a Physbones script to the root of the two breast bone chains.\n3. Attach a GameObject (a cube) to one of the children of the bone with the Physbone script on.\nExpected:\nBoth bone chains transform as expected when in play mode/VRChat\nActual:\nOnly the bone chain without any non-bone child objects transforms.\nWhy this bug stinks:\nThere are lots of avatars that have something attached at the end of a bone chain. This is a pretty common and easy way of customizing an avatar.\nA good example is a pin on someone's chest, which is what has happened in my case.",
